{"n": 593, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "593.webp", "text": "32-16\n\n3241060 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nPOWER STEERING PUMP\n\n3241109 TIGHTENING POWER STEERING\nPUMP DRIVE BELT\n\nDraw off hydraulic fluid in tank. Loosen bolts.\n\nDisconnect lines.\n\nPlug connections with dust caps.\n\nInstallation:\n\nReplace seals.\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nCheck for sufficient space between hoses and\n\nbody-mounted parts.\n\nImportant!\n\nNever reuse drained oil,\n\nLoosen nut (1) and relax drive belt by turning\ntoothed element (2).\n\nLoosen lock nut (1).\nTighten toothed element (2) to torque of 8 ... 8.5\nNm (5.8 ... 6,1 ft. Ibs.) and tighten lock nut again.\n\n3032038\nUnscrew bolts and take off pump. Check or tighten drive belt with tester 115....\ntastallation: 7 Hook (4) rests on tip of tooth.\nTighten drive belt before tightening bolts. Tighten bolts.\nImportant!\n\nCheck for sufficient space between hoses and\nbody-mounted parts, making corrections on\nhose connections if necessary.\n\nTightening Drive Belt:\n\nTighten toothed element to torque of 8 ... 8.5\nNm (5.8 ... 6.1 ft. Ibs.) and lock with nut.\nCheck or correct drive belt tightness with\ntester 115...\n\nHook (4) rests on tip of tooth.\n\nBleed power steering 32 12 006.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["32-16", 0.465, 0.0259, 0.5304, 0.0491], ["3241060", 0.2584, 0.065, 0.3075, 0.0756], ["REMOVING", 0.3207, 0.065, 0.3799, 0.0756], ["AND", 0.384, 0.065, 0.4078, 0.0756], ["INSTALLING", 0.4119, 0.065, 0.4782, 0.0756], ["POWER", 0.3202, 0.0809, 0.3576, 0.0915], ["STEERING", 0.3617, 0.0809, 0.4164, 0.0915], ["PUMP", 0.4205, 0.0809, 0.4498, 0.0915], ["3241109", 0.7487, 0.065, 0.7984, 0.0756], ["TIGHTENING", 0.8116, 0.0637, 0.881, 0.0756], ["POWER", 0.885, 0.0637, 0.923, 0.0749], ["STEERING", 0.9271, 0.0637, 0.9813, 0.0743], ["PUMP", 0.811, 0.0796, 0.8409, 0.0915], ["DRIVE", 0.8445, 0.0796, 0.8789, 0.0902], ["BELT", 0.883, 0.0796, 0.9108, 0.0902], ["Draw", 0.2584, 0.1127, 0.2837, 0.1233], ["off", 0.2867, 0.1121, 0